                  "id": "levelled_description_f0a56aa5fb4d",
                  "level": {
                    "value": 6
                  },
                  "description": {
                    "value": "You devote much of your study to halcyon magic. You gain two common Halcyon cantrips spell and two common 1st-level halcyon spells (see Halcyon Spells on page 100). In addition to being able to cast your halcyon spells via your arcane or primal spell slots, you also gain a 1st-level halcyon spell slot. You can use your halcyon spell slots to spontaneously cast your halcyon spells."
